<title>UK: London gold fixes lowest since December 1985.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes lowest since December 1985.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $324.45 vs $325.20 AM. Lowest since December 1985. Fairly choppy as dealers square up for the weekend. Further losses forecast for next week.</p>
<p>SILVER - Little interest at nine-cent lower $4.55/$4.57.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Quiet at $419.00/$422.00 vs $423.00/$428.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down about $0.50 at $189.00/$193.00.</p>
</text>
